.TH AOC-COOLERCONTROL 8 "2026-11-08" "acer-open-control 0.3.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
aoc-coolercontrol \- CoolerControl device plugin for AcerOpenControl
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aoc-coolercontrol
.RB [ \-\-socket
.IR path ]
.RB [ \-\-aocd
.IR path ]
.RB [ \-\-debug ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A CoolerControl device-service plugin. It is started by
.B coolercontrold
from /var/lib/coolercontrol/plugins/aoc-coolercontrol/ and exposes the laptop's
fans and aocd's CPU/GPU temperatures to CoolerControl over gRPC. Fan control is
borrowed from
.BR aocd (8),
which keeps its fail-safes and takes the fans back as soon as the plugin stops.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-socket " path"
gRPC socket for coolercontrold (default /tmp/aoc-coolercontrol.sock).
.TP
.BI \-\-aocd " path"
aocd socket (default /run/acer-open-control/aocd.sock).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aocd (8),
.BR aocctl (1)
